[{"title":"八月十四夜建中二三友过我清话因共把盏赏月从容谈笑不觉云容朦胧桂影淡泊端知是夕聚首骚池再谐佳会遂成四韵","author":"欧阳澈","text":"冰轮初讶一分亏，结客传觞笑语迟。\n云汉无端藏兔影，金波恨不蘸蟾枝。\n佐樽痛忆飞琼侣，染翰栽成感鬼诗。\n料得中秋月应朗，习池端约捧琼卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15579,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"轩前菊蕊将绽因书四韵示希哲约九日聚饮于此","author":"欧阳澈","text":"菊英装点近芳辰，风掠清香已袭人。\n端的樊川携玉液，来同靖节赏金尘。\n藏阄戏赌杯中物，投辖坚留座上宾。\n恶客不容污我社，摛云要扫笔锋神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15580,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"述怀寄仲宝","author":"欧阳澈","text":"鸡窗俛默谢尘嚣，炙手权门懒折腰。\n节操刚持忠孝砺，胸襟常以古今浇。\n萧条陋巷閒三径，牢落生涯寄一瓢。\n何日高轩能我过，竹林清集共逍遥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15581,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过巴川","author":"欧阳澈","text":"凭高因赋遏云篇，曳屣狂歌放昔贤。\n未遂相如荣驷马，且寻师正傲清泉。\n悲吟玉未经三献，羞涩囊空乏一钱。\n典却春衣常独酌，从教邸主笑鸢肩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15582,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤借韵书怀","author":"欧阳澈","text":"白雪歌诗数百篇，赓酬乐有父兄贤。\n要晞靖节栽门柳，须俟参寥梦石泉。\n咳唾幸存三寸舌，文章可愧一囊钱。\n会须重咏高轩过，呕出蕲攀李贺肩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15583,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和前韵勉子贤学诗","author":"欧阳澈","text":"雕镌风月摘佳篇，落笔尤宜法古贤。\n淬砺要如砻宝剑，清新蕲似冽寒泉。\n会同白句吟披锦，冷笑邕文卖得钱。\n诗社获公添一瑞，苦思须拍阆仙肩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15584,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子贤和韵见酬次答之","author":"欧阳澈","text":"诗名浪得在卢前，器识惭非叔度贤。\n捉月笑他吟采石，凌云端欲赋甘泉。\n发硎喜淬冲牛剑，启齿羞谈使鬼钱。\n平世未应徒尔耳，行藏终与古人肩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15585,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤秋日晚望","author":"欧阳澈","text":"溪山泼墨水云秋，似绮馀霞次第收。\n灿灿拒霜铺蓼岸，双双属玉舞蘋洲。\n杳无锦字来凭雁，拟灭机心试狎鸥。\n望里碧云还又合，数峰江上忍抬眸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15586,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝宗以诗赠行和酬二篇一以留别一以谢诗 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"漱醪常共醉淋浪，鱼目惭游涨海傍。\n琴听雅音弹碧玉，鼎分灵剂炼玄霜。\n缠肠锦绣篇章丽，入室芝兰燕寝香。\n此别未应徒尔耳，鹏程万里事难量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15587,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝宗以诗赠行和酬二篇一以留别一以谢诗 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"锻鍊新诗摘锦囊，笔驱秀丽汝川傍。\n气横阿剑疑干斗，韵逸丰钟必待霜。\n遒劲狂挥毛颖疾，淋漓醉扫麝煤香。\n珠玑喜就鲛人乞，收拾端期百斛量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15588,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆朝宗","author":"欧阳澈","text":"饫聆舌铎向鸡窗，深愧葭蒹倚玉傍。\n妙论乍离人吐屑，渴心欣破橘含霜。\n颇多好景撩人笑，独赏幽丛扑面香。\n数笔江山吟未得，何时对榻细商量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15589,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄敦仁","author":"欧阳澈","text":"高才松桂振芬芳，桃李根茎愧托傍。\n眩目文章舒丽锦，超群节操抗严霜。\n快聋未卜闻谈绮，补劓期攀霭德香。\n时遣长须致双鲤，新诗无惜屡思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15590,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建中索子贤酒债戏作一绝","author":"欧阳澈","text":"阿堵物无崔烈臭，孔方兄有少陵羞。\n一斗酒金偿未得，速来相就典貂裘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15591,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琼上人留意学诗惑于多岐未明厥趣作四韵寤之了此一话则能诗三昩不出个中矣","author":"欧阳澈","text":"襟怀磊落富诗情，琢句端明法颂声。\n格健要除蔬笋气，语工须带雪霜清。\n碧云矜式存风雅，黄卷沈潜学老成。\n锻鍊更能师岛可，禅林无患不知名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15592,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋香","author":"欧阳澈","text":"拂掠轻风破异香，非兰非麝味何长。\n荻筛玉屑飞鱼舍，菊碎金尘点醉乡。\n露裛木犀增馥郁，烟滋菡萏益芬芳。\n佳人惹得盈襟袖，刬地慵拈锦绣囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15593,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋云","author":"欧阳澈","text":"数片悠扬出远山，拟为霖雨霈尘寰。\n未乘风雨吹嘘便，蓦被曦轮照烁还。\n心在苍生常欲起，踪归深岫暂投閒。\n油然一作施膏泽，始趁岚烟入帝关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15594,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋竹","author":"欧阳澈","text":"森然庭列碧琅玕，潇洒清阴透胆寒。\n落落已成栖凤实，团团俱是化龙竿。\n夜深筛月疑金碎，晓色笼烟认戟攒。\n劲节刚持君子操，王猷休把等閒看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15595,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"待月","author":"欧阳澈","text":"停杯邀月宴华堂，苦恨山高阻兴狂。\n海峤岂能藏素魄，云衢终自布寒光。\n须臾帘捲银蟾影，次第樽浮桂子香。\n正好吹箫恰无月，姮娥应见我恓惶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15596,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋月","author":"欧阳澈","text":"碾破鳞云皓月轮，银蟾著意露精神。\n十分素魄高低印，一样寒光远近均。\n触目冰壶无点翳，照人水鉴绝纤尘。\n拟携玉斧乘风御，折桂归荣白发亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15597,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金凤花","author":"欧阳澈","text":"巧剪金英似欲飞，恍疑平世凤来仪。\n嘉名独冠群花首，底事君王尚未知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15598,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋愁","author":"欧阳澈","text":"层楼夜午转西风，眉际新愁刬地浓。\n怪得当时潘与宋，凄凉尤怯此时逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15599,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"阴雨萧萧夜接晨，如云禾稼一番新。\n康衢击壤歌声沸，乐岁应无甑里尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15600,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"涤破骄阳变早秋，烟光清照北山幽。\n五湖遥想增潇洒，谁棹扁舟继蠡游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15601,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"浮云谁谓出无心，甘雨祁祁润泽深。\n潭底老龙徒久卧，亢阳何事不为霖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15602,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其四","author":"欧阳澈","text":"云岩萧索雨初晴，嫩玉寒泉分外清。\n可笑蜩螗时快意，也依浓荫吐微声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15603,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其五","author":"欧阳澈","text":"画坼田龟久望云，霈然膏泽幸盈津。\n南邻来庆年丰稔，旋酌香醪共湿唇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15604,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其六","author":"欧阳澈","text":"北窗支枕梦初回，风掠馀香特地来。\n颠倒衣裳望池上，荷花无语为谁开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15605,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其七","author":"欧阳澈","text":"霜筠瑟瑟戛琳琅，冷透纱厨一味凉。\n破梦吟魂正潇洒，纤纤更捧雪花香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15606,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨八绝寄显道作 其八","author":"欧阳澈","text":"杨柳藏鸦菡萏香，水亭风榭袭罗裳。\n秋光正入诗人眼，剩得馀篇付锦囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15607,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉吟","author":"欧阳澈","text":"酒酣逸气射星斗，自恨无人识马周。\n试拂青蛇歌易水，溪山应有鬼神愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15608,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重九前一日对菊戏书","author":"欧阳澈","text":"菊吐金英已满篱，持杯指准赏芳菲。\n有巾可漉还无酿，载酒何人是白衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15609,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读萧防遇仙传戏书一绝","author":"欧阳澈","text":"华阳宫阙杳难寻，空有遗踪古到今。\n不识萧郎仙去后，床头花酝共谁斟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15610,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"览丁渥异梦记戏书一绝示内人","author":"欧阳澈","text":"梦魂千里入巫峰，况在鸳帏咫尺中。\n笔洒新诗宜赠我，临风幸免倩征鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15611,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"德秀和朝宗绝句意似有不平者依韵作三绝以代其解嘲 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"琪管将扬世罕知，不辞三弄试临溪。\n少陵若也能精鉴，休戏严公有此儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15612,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"德秀和朝宗绝句意似有不平者依韵作三绝以代其解嘲 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"藏器韬光以待时，扁舟且此钓磻溪。\n拿云指日掀头角，惊破扶风狎侮儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15613,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"德秀和朝宗绝句意似有不平者依韵作三绝以代其解嘲 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"东野临流喜赋诗，一竿摇破碧云溪。\n汝非羸角休吾触，不是寻常丱角儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15614,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元诗末篇之意二绝寄友人 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"功名未许书麟阁，吟醉何妨晦竹溪。\n舌在自知非久困，且将诗礼教龟儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15615,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元诗末篇之意二绝寄友人 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"酒圣会须中北海，机锋谁敢触曹溪。\n英雄自有回天力，造化都来只小儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15616,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"信马沿堤懒著鞭，不堪回首望临川。\n满怀离恨如春梦，愁听林梢断续蝉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15617,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"欲破閒愁殢举觞，醉中行色转凄凉。\n眼封无物堪消遣，望尽江城断尽肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15618,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"廉纤小雨破炎蒸，马上襟怀顿觉清。\n暂解征鞍访村叟，一瓯春露醒馀酲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15619,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其四","author":"欧阳澈","text":"一声啼鸟过残阳，髣髴流莺促晓妆。\n记得年时倦梳裹，殢人和笑道天凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15620,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其五","author":"欧阳澈","text":"寸碧遥岑隐半规，冰轮次第碾琉璃。\n因追胜集琼楼杪，笑倩纤纤捧酒卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15621,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其六","author":"欧阳澈","text":"挑尽寒灯夜欲分，襟怀岑寂向谁论。\n香残读彻閒攲枕，髣髴音容入梦魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15622,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其七","author":"欧阳澈","text":"啾唧蛩吟旅况凄，那堪孤枕酒醒时。\n梦魂栩栩知何处，依约幽轩话别离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15623,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归自临川途中感物遇事得八绝句寄秀美 其八","author":"欧阳澈","text":"窗含月影梦初回，一枕凄凉眼懒开。\n幽恨閒愁本无种，根苗不识是谁栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15624,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有寄二绝 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"标格全归笑靥中，相逢无奈去匆匆。\n金钗若许重寻约，樽酒秦楼愿与同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15625,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有寄二绝 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"懵腾醉眼漾娇波，心印潜通一捻多。\n密寄断肠双丽曲，遏云须倩雪儿歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15626,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"懵腾醉眼未全醒，厌听田鸦达旦鸣。\n款段踏穿杨柳月，快人拂面晓风轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15627,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"暂停双桨傍蘋洲，矶上渔翁雪满头。\n钓破烟波深得趣，生来不识世间愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15628,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"凉飙未夺火云权，烁石炎曦势欲燃。\n妄意拟寻河朔饮，狂歌烂醉太平年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15629,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其四","author":"欧阳澈","text":"旗亭贳酒醉淋浪，赢得林间一味凉。\n倒著接䍦还信马，只忧蹊径似羊肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15630,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其五","author":"欧阳澈","text":"巴陵崒嵂试跻攀，胜概全归指顾间。\n笑倚松风聊洗耳，隔云好鸟语间关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15631,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其六","author":"欧阳澈","text":"麟阁功名属少年，笑他皓首只翛然。\n闻名虽未披云雾，勉力期攀鲁仲连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15632,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其七","author":"欧阳澈","text":"索寞襟怀不奈秋，雕镌佳句且忘忧。\n行行恰过桥南路，一片芦花映碧流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15633,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其八","author":"欧阳澈","text":"黄粱餐罢倚危亭，茗枕琼花助解酲。\n旅况吟魂正潇洒，拂鞍迤逦又登程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15634,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子贤途中九绝 其九","author":"欧阳澈","text":"桐圭柳带正凋疏，匹马区区倦远途。\n肠断不堪回首处，寒云影里雁声孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15635,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈国镇五绝 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"德香薰郁书银笔，句法清新夺锦袍。\n卓荦斗南推第一，才名藉甚继三豪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15636,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈国镇五绝 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"才华拔萃东南美，气焰凌空表里清。\n莫逆于心蒙许友，攀麟雁塔要联名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15637,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈国镇五绝 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"未观健笔龙蛇走，拾得残篇绮思新。\n语带烟霞含劲气，解龟谁醉谪仙人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15638,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈国镇五绝 其四","author":"欧阳澈","text":"鳌头帘捲溪山秀，麈尾风生议论清。\n解榻何时同一笑，密云旋煮破馀酲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15639,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈国镇五绝 其五","author":"欧阳澈","text":"冷暖世情谙已熟，雌黄舆议厌常闻。\n龟囚蚕缚末由脱，樽酒何时与重论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15640,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答国镇五绝 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"仙风入骨楚臣骚，消得明皇赐绣袍。\n哦就新篇神物护，未饶禹锡擅诗豪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15641,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答国镇五绝 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"年时煮茗共敲冰，澡雪襟怀一种清。\n回首旧游浑似梦，翻惭困踣未知名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15642,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答国镇五绝 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"十围便腹卧边先，笑傲羲皇仿昔贤。\n诏下好须同奋跃，槐花香里走连钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15643,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答国镇五绝 其四","author":"欧阳澈","text":"学辨痴龙信博哉，风流夷甫更多才。\n拟联石鼎弥明句，对耸诗肩夜拾煤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15644,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和答国镇五绝 其五","author":"欧阳澈","text":"吟须轻撚对斜阳，叶扫平林夜著霜。\n忽领诗词云锦段，夜光明月耀黉堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15645,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄游良臣五绝 其一","author":"欧阳澈","text":"萤窗顾我绝韦编，砥节思齐叔度贤。\n谁念广文穷到骨，倾囊时与杖头钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15646,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄游良臣五绝 其二","author":"欧阳澈","text":"阘茸闾阎数米炊，耳根舆议噪蛙卑。\n那知别得琴中趣，五斗犹惭为折枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15647,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄游良臣五绝 其三","author":"欧阳澈","text":"壮浪年来笔有神，诗如开府顿清新。\n暗中慎莫投珠璧，道路无非按剑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15648,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄游良臣五绝 其四","author":"欧阳澈","text":"登云胜概脱风埃，顿费诗仙赋咏才。\n忆得年时共轰饮，罗衣曾暗裛香煤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15649,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄游良臣五绝 其五","author":"欧阳澈","text":"文会何时聚德星，紫芝眉宇照人清。\n锦鞯并控寻春马，持酒冯花为解酲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":15650,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]